## 2. PLANNING PERMISSION LEADS
==============================================

### Competitors
- **Planning Alerts.com** — Free weekly planning email alerts (basic)
- **Local council websites** — Free but you have to check yourself
- **Builders Lead Generator** — Premium planning lead services (£150-300/mo)
- **PropertyData** — Property analytics (£14/mo but not lead-focused)

### What They Do Well
- PlanningAlerts is free (but limited and unreliable)
- PropertyData has great filters and analytics

### Where They Fall Short
- PlanningAlerts: Inconsistent, no guarantee of delivery, no CRM
- Builders Lead Gen: Expensive and don't know their exact pricing
- No service filters by property type, project type, or value
- No daily email with actionable leads

### How We Beat Them
| Factor | PlanningAlerts | Builders Lead Gen | Planning Leads |
|--------|---------------|-------------------|----------------|
| Price | Free | £150-300/mo | £147/mo |
| Reliability | Inconsistent | Unknown | Daily guaranteed |
| Filters | Postcode only | Unknown | Area + type + value |
| Delivery | Weekly email | Unknown | Daily email + CSV |
| Support | None | Phone | Email + chat |

### Value Props To Lead With
- "Every planning application is £10k-£100k of work. Get them before other builders."
- "Kitchen fitters: people extending their homes need new kitchens. We find them first."
- "Architects: every extension needs an architect. We send you the address before they've even chosen one."
- "50% cheaper than dedicated builder lead services — with better filters."

